1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,826
CRM ka teesra section — Payment Behaviour.

2
00:00:02,826 --> 00:00:06,124
Har customer ka payment pattern analyse hota hai.

3
00:00:06,124 --> 00:00:09,691
Pay Ratio dikhta hai — kitna sales value pay ho gaya.

4
00:00:09,691 --> 00:00:13,729
80 percent se upar green, 50 se 80 yellow, 50 se neeche red.

5
00:00:13,729 --> 00:00:17,700
Avg Delay bhi hai — average kitne din late paise aate hain.

6
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:21,133
Score column ek combined rating hai — 0 se 100 tak.

7
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:24,633
High score matlab reliable customer, credit badhaao.

8
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:28,267
Low score matlab careful raho, advance payment maango.

9
00:00:28,267 --> 00:00:33,718
Yeh data business decisions mein bahut useful hai kis customer ko credit dena hai

10
00:00:33,718 --> 00:00:34,392
kise nahi.
